# Home Lab Infrastructure

Personal infrastructure lab built around Proxmox VE.

## Hardware

| Component | Specification |
|---|---|
| CPU | AMD Ryzen 9 7900 |
| CPU Cores | 12 cores / 24 threads |
| RAM | 128 GB DDR5 ECC |
| Storage | 1 TB NVMe + 2 × 2 TB NVMe |
| Network | 10 GbE |
| Public IP | Dedicated public IP |
| Hypervisor | Proxmox VE |

## Architecture

```text
Internet
   |
Dedicated Public IP
   |
Edge Firewall
   |
10 GbE
   |
Proxmox VE
   |
   +-- Management VLAN
   +-- Server VLAN
   +-- DMZ VLAN
   +-- Client VLAN
   +-- IoT VLAN
   +-- Lab VLAN
```

## VLANs

| VLAN | Network | Purpose |
|---:|---|---|
| 10 | 10.10.10.0/24 | Management |
| 20 | 10.10.20.0/24 | Servers |
| 30 | 10.10.30.0/24 | DMZ |
| 40 | 10.10.40.0/24 | Clients |
| 50 | 10.10.50.0/24 | IoT |
| 60 | 10.10.60.0/24 | Lab |

## VM Inventory

| VM | Purpose | vCPU | RAM | VLAN |
|---|---|---:|---:|---:|
| docker-01 | Docker workloads | 6 | 16 GB | 20 |
| monitor-01 | Monitoring | 4 | 8 GB | 20 |
| proxy-01 | Reverse proxy | 2 | 4 GB | 30 |
| lab-01 | Testing / experiments | 4 | 8 GB | 60 |

## Storage

| Device | Size | Purpose |
|---|---:|---|
| NVMe-01 | 1 TB | Proxmox / system |
| NVMe-02 | 2 TB | Primary VM storage |
| NVMe-03 | 2 TB | Application / lab storage |

Local storage is not considered a backup.

## Goals

- Build a realistic self-hosted infrastructure environment
- Practice virtualization with Proxmox VE
- Practice Linux administration
- Deploy containerized applications
- Implement network segmentation
- Build monitoring and alerting
- Automate configuration with Ansible
- Document infrastructure and operational procedures
- Practice backup and disaster recovery procedures

