## Security

- Management interfaces should not be exposed directly to the Internet.
- Inter-VLAN traffic should be denied by default.
- Secrets should never be committed to Git.
- Public services should be isolated in the DMZ.
- Administrative access should use SSH keys where possible.
- Infrastructure changes should be documented.

